  "result": "`acceptInvitation` in `src/server/services/invitation-service.ts` now refuses revoked invitations. I haven't run the tests.\n\nThe function only checked whether the invitation had been accepted and whether it had expired. It never looked at `revokedAt`, so a cancelled invitation still went through and created a membership. I added a check for `revokedAt` that throws \"That invitation has been revoked\". It sits between the already-accepted check and the expiry check.\n\nI didn't look at the repository lookup, so I didn't confirm whether it returns revoked rows. That matters for the message: if it filters them out, the user gets the \"not found\" error instead of this one.",
